---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_timing: authorized
    q_check_timing --> q_check_not_published: block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period not ended
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_check_not_published --> q_set_merkle: results not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert_published: already published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_set_merkle --> q_set_totals: set acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
    q_set_totals --> q_emit: set totalAllocatedTokens AND totalAcceptedCapital
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleResultsPublished(merkleRoot, totalAllocatedTokens, totalAcceptedCapital)

    note right of q_set_merkle
        INV-001: Only callable after refund period ends
        INV-002: Results can only be published once
        INV-003: Merkle root commits to final per-investor accepted capital
        INV-004: Only Legion operators can publish results
    end note
